  "details": "There's some behaviors I've noticed with the beta I feel might be worth pointing out:\n\n- Going into the steam menu forces the open hand gesture on both hands even though the gesture itself is not active. Ideally it should be on the rest position\n\n- ~I'm unable to grab and pose anyone's physbones in the beta even though trigger is set to grab.~ (Edit: the grab is set to grip, this is wrong but can be rebound to the trigger)",
